    "long_instructions": "## Use AI to Code Your Web App - Style \r\n\r\n1. **Prompt AI for CSS**  \r\n   Ask AI to create the style for the web app you outlined for your selected user. Copy and paste the prompt you drafted in Level 1 and clarify that you just want the `style.css` file.\r\n\r\n2. **Accept and Save**  \r\n   Briefly describe what AI changed, e.g. `Created style.css for garden web app` Then click **\"Accept and save version\"**. \r\n   \r\n_Note: Your HTML code should carry over from the previous level._",
